  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNECA JFA 2010-2012</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">UNECA JFA 2010-2012</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Program support to UNECA&apos;s 3 yr &quot;business plan&quot; 2010-2012 through a   joing financing agreement (JFA)to 8 thematic areas: econ dev &amp; NEPAD, climate (a separate contribution and spec agreement but under the     JFA), food sec &amp; sust dev, good governance &amp; publ admin, ICT, reg     integr &amp; trade (under the same spec agreement but a separate          contribution), gender equality &amp; soc dev, and statistics.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Programst&#xf6;d till UNECAs 3-&#xe5;riga &quot;aff&#xe4;rsplan&quot; 2010 - 2012 genom ett    gemensamt finansieringsavtal (JFA) till 8 tematiska omr&#xe5;den: ekon utv &amp; NEPAD, klimat (separat insats och avtal men under samma JFA),       livsmedelstrygghet &amp; h&#xe5;llbar utv, god samh&#xe4;llsstyrning &amp; off f&#xf6;rvalt, ICT &amp; vetenskap/teknologi,regional integration &amp; handel (samma avtal  men separat insats), j&#xe4;mst&#xe4;lldhet &amp; soc utv, samt statistik.</narrative>
  </description>
